WEBVTT

00:35:28.005 --> 00:35:30.353
But it was definitely
part of our language.

00:35:30.377 --> 00:35:36.828
I think people are very capable
of convincing themselves

00:35:36.852 --> 00:35:43.265
that actions that most
would recognize as taking

00:35:43.289 --> 00:35:45.444
are in the service of giving.

00:35:47.241 --> 00:35:52.137
And I think it's a really
fine line and slippery slope.

00:35:53.435 --> 00:35:59.315
But I would say that that's
what was believed.

00:35:59.339 --> 00:36:03.115
That the things that were being done
were best for the collective,